#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:5
#: cc2b816358d047678d2fc4a4aaf37de4
msgid "Home-Made Power Tether"
msgstr "自制电源系绳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:7
#: 06abf572c32641c282fa61ce7c01399f
msgid ""
"For Maker-Faire 2017, the Cube Autopilot team needed a power tether for the "
"ArduCopter-following-ArduRover demonstration.  Plans to use a commercially-"
"available tether collapsed so Mr Challinger and Mr Wurzbach made a DIY "
"tether in just 24h."
msgstr ""
"为参加 2017 年 Maker Faire，Cube 飞控团队需要为「ArduCopter 跟随 "
"ArduRover」演示准备电源系绳。原计划使用商用系绳的方案落空，Mr Challinger 和 Mr Wurzbach 在 24 "
"小时内手工制作了一根 DIY 系绳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:11
#: 26e7b3fa77574debb567c15d0523155a
msgid ""
"The equipment described here deals with high power electronics which can "
"damage electrical equipment and even kill people if not done properly.  "
"Please be confident in your abilities before attempting to replicate this "
"project."
msgstr "本文所述设备涉及大功率电子器件，操作不当可能损坏电气设备甚至危及人身安全。请在有充分把握的情况下再尝试复制此项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:14
#: 11a9df09210e47ca817f6c60aeadb4a9
msgid "Demonstration"
msgstr "演示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:20
