msgstr "使用的零件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:21
#: ffeb20a78fa04eb1890e9b2c3c3706d5
msgid ""
"AC to DC Power Supply Single Output 27 Volt 56 Amp (`like this one "
"<http://www.jameco.com/z/RSP-1500-27-Mean-Well-AC-to-DC-Power-Supply-Single-"
"Output-27-Volt-56-Amp-1-512kw_694946.html>`__)"
msgstr ""
"AC 转 DC 电源，单路输出 27V 56A（`类似这款 <http://www.jameco.com/z/RSP-1500-27-Mean-"
"Well-AC-to-DC-Power-Supply-Single-"
"Output-27-Volt-56-Amp-1-512kw_694946.html>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:22
#: 043f14efcd754464be165d7c44735d5b
msgid ""
"600 Watt Surface Mount Transient Voltage Suppressor (`like this one "
"<https://www.jameco.com/z/NMBJ24A-13-F-Diodes-Zetex-600-Watt-Surface-Mount-"
"Transient-Voltage-Suppressor_1542371.html>`__)"
msgstr ""
"600W 表面贴装瞬态电压抑制器（`类似这款 <https://www.jameco.com/z/NMBJ24A-13-F-Diodes-"
"Zetex-600-Watt-Surface-Mount-Transient-Voltage-Suppressor_1542371.html>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:23
